{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic worlds collide in a hand-drawn cartoon smash-up! Royalty Free For All, an approachable party brawler remixes characters, settings, and songs from the public domain.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/ab29969b049d9c0bfa82f5459ae0ca35.poster.avif?t=1761624158\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/ab29969b049d9c0bfa82f5459ae0ca35.webm?t=1761624158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Royalty Free-For-All brings an expressive cartoon twist and fun fighting game abilities to timeless heroes and villains like Dorothy Gale, Sweeney Todd, Lancelot, and more! Whether you fight on Old Macdonald's farm, The Center of the Earth, The Hundred-Acre Wood, every frame of every scene is hand-drawn and brought to life with a gorgeous art style inspired by animation cells and watercolor backgrounds some of the world's most famous settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/9ef8bf8b80440019e450afa7362d7b36.poster.avif?t=1761624158\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/9ef8bf8b80440019e450afa7362d7b36.webm?t=1761624158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royalty Free-For-All celebrates a wide range of ages and skillsets by making the genre more accessible than ever while maintaining its exciting pace and beloved mobility techniques. Light, Strong, and Special attacks make the zany flow of combat feel straightforward, even for first time players. So no more friends or family giving up after one match: Royalty Free-For-All is easy to learn and fun for everyone!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/0b148d1f443e7d7eb3ae0e47cf5c0078.poster.avif?t=1761624158\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/0b148d1f443e7d7eb3ae0e47cf5c0078.webm?t=1761624158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can enjoy madcap cartoon battles full of exciting combos and hilarious interactions together in local multiplayer\u2014or, thanks to its rollback netcode, you can get good online in both 1v1 and four-player quickplay modes, and even host private lobbies to play with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royalty Free-For-All\u2122 is in development for \u00a0PC and consoles. Interested players can stay up to date as development continues by wishlisting it on Steam and following on its socials on Twitter, Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, and TikTok, and even cast their vote for future content by visiting our website! All these links can be found in the game page to your right.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3176720?t=1761624158","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/17239064f43cbc13af690a54ad35bc84b891f1fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761624158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/e2c1ad1c7e291d17d743e20967604adb71a908f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761624158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as